OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after violent robbery at
OL,4,Ajewellery store
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 55-year-old man has died a week after
OL,7,Fbeing seriously injured during a
OL,8,Fviolent robbery at a jewellery store in
OL,9,FPeterborough.
OL,11,FAnsar Mahmood, who is believed to be
OL,12,Fthe owner of Lala Jewellers on
OL,13,FGladstone Street, was attacked when six
OL,14,Fmen targeted the shop shortly before
OL,15,F12:00 GMT on Saturday, Cambridgeshire
OL,16,FPolice said.
OL,18,FMahmood, of Eastfield Road, was taken
OL,19,Fto hospital and died on Friday,
OL,20,Fsurrounded by his family.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,379,370,200,160,0,100
