OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after violent robbery at
OL,4,Ajewellery store
OL,5,
OL,6,FSubur Ahmed, 20, and Wasim Iqbal, 43,
OL,7,Fboth of Upper Seymour Street, Bradford,
OL,8,Fappeared at Cambridge Magistrates'
OL,9,FCourt on Friday charged with robbery in
OL,10,Fconnection with the incident.
